Source: just
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/casey/just
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: just
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: handy way to save and run project-specific commands
 just is a command runner written in Rust. Commands, called recipes, are
 stored in a file called a justfile with syntax inspired by make. It can be
 used to run project-specific commands, with support for dependency
 management, recipes with parameters, and modules.
